# brain-stem: managed secret-exclusions
# Seeded into $CLAUDE_HOME/.gitignore at install time (install.sh Step 11.8).
# Deny-list-at-the-VCS-boundary: these surfaces NEVER enter the git index, so the
# backup wrapper (skills/librarian/capabilities/backup.sh) cannot exfiltrate them
# to a remote. Belt-and-suspenders with the staged-diff token scanner.
# Secret-bearing surfaces:
settings.local.json
.pre-uninstall-*/
projects/
# Runtime state + always-noise:
*.key
*.pem
*.registry
sk-ant-*
.DS_Store
